  "topic": "Handling logistics issues and delivery delays in a professional context",
  "body": "Hello, this is Marcus Thorne from Global Logistics Solutions. I am calling regarding your order number 8842, which was scheduled for delivery this Thursday. Unfortunately, due to an unexpected customs delay at the border, your shipment has been held up. We expect the clearance process to be completed by tomorrow morning, meaning your delivery will likely be delayed by approximately two business days. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause to your project timeline. I will send a follow-up email with the updated tracking link shortly. If you have any urgent questions, please call me back at extension 402. Thank you."
